# LangScope - everything inside speaks this language (es | en …): the library's words, its dates and its Customs follow
# it. Without it they follow the page's <html lang>, English when there is none. A store in the shop's language:
#   LangScope(lang: shopLang) { … the store's parts … }
# shadcn-for-muten · Custom · host JS is lang-scope.js.
part LangScope(lang: text) { Stack class("cx-lang-scope") { Custom LangScope inputs(lang: $lang) class("cx-lang-host")  slot } }
